---
description: Investigate the returning receiver and interpret the authentic retained delivery for this request.
args:
  goal: string
  assignment: DeliveryWakeAssignment
returns: DeliveryWakeInvestigation
---
Establish what the original addressed receiver can currently prove. inspectDeliveryWake reads the scoped native reconnect, receiver, cursor, range and mailbox. matchDeliveryWakeEvent preserves an exact native event and its current mailbox entry, without replacing an original terminal with similar wording or progress from another request.
Use assessWakeContinuity to judge what these facts mean for the user's request and whether recovery is requested and safe. bindWakeInvestigation keeps the actual evidence and event objects with that semantic plan. This investigation has no recovery writer; explain uncertainty or an unmet condition honestly instead of inventing a completion.
